WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.412 --> 00:00:03.523
- She's a media producer,
actress, talk show host,

00:00:03.523 --> 00:00:04.836
and philanthropist.

00:00:04.836 --> 00:00:07.154
- She's best known for her talk show.

00:00:07.154 --> 00:00:10.249
- She is worth three billion dollars.

00:00:10.249 --> 00:00:14.416
- She's Oprah and here are
her top 10 rules for success.

00:00:17.814 --> 00:00:21.731
- The way through the
challenge is to get still

00:00:22.893 --> 00:00:26.881
and ask yourself, what
is the next right move?

00:00:26.881 --> 00:00:29.518
Not think about oh I
got all of this to do.

00:00:29.518 --> 00:00:31.796
What is the next right move?

00:00:31.796 --> 00:00:34.691
And then from that space,
make the next right move

00:00:34.691 --> 00:00:36.246
and the next right move.

00:00:36.246 --> 00:00:37.896
And not to be overwhelmed by it

00:00:37.896 --> 00:00:39.884
because you know your life is bigger

00:00:39.884 --> 00:00:41.212
than that one moment.

00:00:41.212 --> 00:00:43.394
You know you're not defined by

00:00:43.394 --> 00:00:46.234
what somebody says is a failure for you

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:48.042
because failure is just there to point you

00:00:48.042 --> 00:00:49.485
in a different direction.

00:00:49.485 --> 00:00:52.818
Nothing about my life is lucky, nothing.

00:00:55.137 --> 00:00:58.374
A lot of grace, a lot of blessings,

00:00:58.374 --> 00:01:00.207
a lot of divine order,

00:01:01.982 --> 00:01:04.315
but I don't believe in luck.

00:01:05.243 --> 00:01:06.866
For me luck is preparation

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:10.232
meeting the moment of opportunity.

00:01:10.232 --> 00:01:11.565
There is no luck

00:01:12.812 --> 00:01:15.517
without you being prepared to handle

00:01:15.517 --> 00:01:17.829
that moment of opportunity

00:01:17.829 --> 00:01:21.320
and so what I would say for myself is that

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:23.653
because of my hand in a hand

00:01:24.777 --> 00:01:26.777
and a force greater than my own,

00:01:26.777 --> 00:01:29.218
I had been prepared in ways

00:01:29.218 --> 00:01:32.392
that I didn't even know
I was being prepared for.

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:33.900
And the truth is,

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.233
for me and for every person,

00:01:38.741 --> 00:01:43.432
every single thing that has
ever happened in your life

00:01:43.432 --> 00:01:47.707
is preparing you for the
moment that is to come.

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:50.287
You don't have to hold yourself hostage

00:01:50.287 --> 00:01:52.219
to who you used to be

00:01:52.219 --> 00:01:54.518
or anything you ever used to do

00:01:54.518 --> 00:01:57.538
'cause who has lived and
hasn't made mistakes?

00:01:57.538 --> 00:01:59.225
When I think about my 20s

00:01:59.225 --> 00:02:01.312
and what a foolish girl I was

00:02:01.312 --> 00:02:04.145
and how I would give over my power

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:09.146
to men who really didn't mean me well,

00:02:09.146 --> 00:02:11.437
but now I hold no grudges
against them either

00:02:11.437 --> 00:02:14.902
because I realized, I'm the
one who gave over the power

00:02:14.902 --> 00:02:17.471
because I didn't know any better.

00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:19.341
And now that I know better,

00:02:19.341 --> 00:02:21.881
I know I don't have to do that again.

00:02:21.881 --> 00:02:24.667
It's one of the most powerful lessons

00:02:24.667 --> 00:02:26.667
any of us can ever know.

00:02:27.522 --> 00:02:30.934
I say to my girls all of the time

00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:32.517
that your real work

00:02:33.929 --> 00:02:35.262
is to figure out

00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:38.365
where your power base is

00:02:39.895 --> 00:02:42.895
and to work on the alignment of your

00:02:44.912 --> 00:02:48.040
personality, your gifts
that you have to give,

00:02:48.040 --> 00:02:50.347
with the real reason why you're here.

00:02:50.347 --> 00:02:53.446
That's the number one
thing you have to do.

00:02:53.446 --> 00:02:57.279
Is to work on yourself
and to fill yourself up

00:02:58.903 --> 00:03:02.947
and keep your cup full,
keep yourself full.

00:03:02.947 --> 00:03:05.047
Now I used to be afraid of that,

00:03:05.047 --> 00:03:06.264
I used to be afraid.

00:03:06.264 --> 00:03:07.481
Particularly from people who say,

00:03:07.481 --> 00:03:10.253
"Oh she's so full of
herself, she's so full."

00:03:10.253 --> 00:03:11.576
(crowd laughs)

00:03:11.576 --> 00:03:13.326
And now I embrace it,

00:03:14.630 --> 00:03:18.797
I consider it a compliment
that I am full of myself

00:03:19.885 --> 00:03:22.495
because only when you're full,

00:03:22.495 --> 00:03:24.019
I'm full, I'm overflowing,

00:03:24.019 --> 00:03:25.686
my cup runneth over,

00:03:26.669 --> 00:03:28.972
I have so much to offer
and so much to give

00:03:28.972 --> 00:03:32.222
and I am not afraid of honoring myself.

00:03:34.487 --> 00:03:37.028
It's miraculous when you think about it.

00:03:37.028 --> 00:03:38.071
I would say to my team,

00:03:38.071 --> 00:03:39.037
"Welp, doesn't matter."

00:03:39.037 --> 00:03:41.328
'Cause every season somebody
else was coming out.

00:03:41.328 --> 00:03:43.471
One talk show, two talk
shows, three talk shows,

00:03:43.471 --> 00:03:46.374
there'd been over a 100
talk shows since we started,

00:03:46.374 --> 00:03:47.983
but every time,

00:03:47.983 --> 00:03:49.478
I would feel like alright,

00:03:49.478 --> 00:03:51.993
got to step up our game,
got to step up our game.

00:03:51.993 --> 00:03:53.634
The way you step up your game is not

00:03:53.634 --> 00:03:56.432
to worry about the other
guy in any situation

00:03:56.432 --> 00:03:58.937
'cause you can't control the other guy.

00:03:58.937 --> 00:04:01.567
You cannot control the other guy,

00:04:01.567 --> 00:04:03.520
you only have control over yourself.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.804
So it's like running a race,

00:04:05.804 --> 00:04:07.257
the energy that it takes to look back

00:04:07.257 --> 00:04:08.573
and see where the other guys are,

00:04:08.573 --> 00:04:09.923
takes energy away from you

00:04:09.923 --> 00:04:11.985
and if they're too close

00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:13.207
it scares you.

00:04:13.207 --> 00:04:15.164
So that's what I would say
to my team all the time.

00:04:15.164 --> 00:04:17.069
Don't waste your time in
the race looking back to see

00:04:17.069 --> 00:04:19.215
where the other guy is or
what the other guy is doing.

00:04:19.215 --> 00:04:20.433
It's not about the other guy,

00:04:20.433 --> 00:04:22.148
it's about what can you do?

00:04:22.148 --> 00:04:26.015
You just need to run that
race as hard as you can.

00:04:26.015 --> 00:04:28.153
You need to give it everything you've got

00:04:28.153 --> 00:04:30.689
all the time for yourself.

00:04:30.689 --> 00:04:31.876
My grandmother was a maid,

00:04:31.876 --> 00:04:34.140
that's all she ever knew.

00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.478
The only real expectation she held for me

00:04:36.478 --> 00:04:39.501
was that I would one day become a maid

00:04:39.501 --> 00:04:40.851
and in her words,

00:04:40.851 --> 00:04:42.377
"Have some good white folks,"

00:04:42.377 --> 00:04:46.216
meaning people who would not
speak negatively about me,

00:04:46.216 --> 00:04:48.118
who would allow me to take food home,

00:04:48.118 --> 00:04:50.059
who would be good to me.

00:04:50.059 --> 00:04:54.137
Would treat me with some
level of dignity and respect,

00:04:54.137 --> 00:04:57.238
that was my grandmother's dream for me,

00:04:57.238 --> 00:05:00.107
but I had another dream for myself.

00:05:00.107 --> 00:05:04.782
Another, more than a dream,
I had a belief for myself.

00:05:04.782 --> 00:05:09.608
And I remember watching her
hang out clothes on a line

00:05:09.608 --> 00:05:11.165
one day and say to me,

00:05:11.165 --> 00:05:12.561
"You have to watch me Oprah Gail

00:05:12.561 --> 00:05:15.283
"'cause one day you'll have
to do this for yourself,"

00:05:15.283 --> 00:05:17.246
and knowing inside myself that

00:05:17.246 --> 00:05:19.385
that was not going to be my life.

00:05:19.385 --> 00:05:22.450
Don't know how I knew it other than

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:24.258
that thing that we all have,

00:05:24.258 --> 00:05:25.624
intuition or instinct,

00:05:25.624 --> 00:05:28.721
that said no this will not be my life.

00:05:28.721 --> 00:05:31.199
But because I sense that

00:05:31.199 --> 00:05:32.578
and was connected to that,

00:05:32.578 --> 00:05:36.128
and I remember it was a very still moment.

00:05:36.128 --> 00:05:39.456
It was quiet and I was still
and I was watching her,

00:05:39.456 --> 00:05:42.329
I could see her right now with
the clothespins in her mouth

00:05:42.329 --> 00:05:43.980
and putting them on the line

00:05:43.980 --> 00:05:45.815
and seeing the breath,

00:05:45.815 --> 00:05:49.231
because it was cold, the
moisture coming from her lips,

00:05:49.231 --> 00:05:51.565
and I knew that that would not be my life.

00:05:51.565 --> 00:05:55.212
I knew that I would not be
hanging clothes on a line

00:05:55.212 --> 00:05:56.908
in a backyard in Mississippi.

00:05:56.908 --> 00:05:59.407
So I was either four or five years old

00:05:59.407 --> 00:06:03.870
and that belief that
that would not be my life

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:07.093
is what I held onto for
the longest of times.

00:06:07.093 --> 00:06:09.210
I just, no matter what,

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:12.244
believed that there was something

00:06:12.244 --> 00:06:14.661
bigger, greater, more for me.

00:06:15.949 --> 00:06:17.412
I always understood that there

00:06:17.412 --> 00:06:20.637
really was no difference
between me and the audience.

00:06:20.637 --> 00:06:22.932
At times, I might have had better shoes,

00:06:22.932 --> 00:06:24.432
but at the core of

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.693
what really matters,

00:06:28.693 --> 00:06:30.212
that we are the same.

00:06:30.212 --> 00:06:31.424
And you know how I know that?

00:06:31.424 --> 00:06:34.523
'Cause all of us are
seeking the same thing.

00:06:34.523 --> 00:06:37.441
You're here at this fabulous school

00:06:37.441 --> 00:06:39.903
and will go out into the world

00:06:39.903 --> 00:06:41.357
and each pursue,

00:06:41.357 --> 00:06:44.492
based upon what you
believe your talents are,

00:06:44.492 --> 00:06:47.936
what your skills are,
maybe your gifts are.

00:06:47.936 --> 00:06:49.932
But you're seeking the same thing.

00:06:49.932 --> 00:06:54.099
Everybody wants to fulfill
the highest truest expression

00:06:55.829 --> 00:06:58.246
of yourself as a human being.

00:06:59.169 --> 00:07:01.017
That's what you're looking for,

00:07:01.017 --> 00:07:04.434
the highest truest expression of yourself

00:07:05.519 --> 00:07:06.444
as a human being.

00:07:06.444 --> 00:07:08.406
And because I understand that,

00:07:08.406 --> 00:07:10.871
I understand that if
you're working in a bakery,

00:07:10.871 --> 00:07:12.670
and that's where you want to be,

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:15.226
and that may be what
you always wanted to do,

00:07:15.226 --> 00:07:18.261
is to bake pies for people
or bake cakes for people

00:07:18.261 --> 00:07:20.550
or to offer your gift,

00:07:20.550 --> 00:07:23.171
then that's for you and
there's no difference

00:07:23.171 --> 00:07:25.885
between you and me except
that's your platform,

00:07:25.885 --> 00:07:27.726
that's your show every day.

00:07:27.726 --> 00:07:31.881
So my understanding of
that has allowed me to--

00:07:31.881 --> 00:07:32.928
- [Host] Reach everyone.

00:07:32.928 --> 00:07:35.738
- To reach everyone and there's
no way that you wouldn't

00:07:35.738 --> 00:07:39.078
because that's what I truly feel.

00:07:39.078 --> 00:07:41.081
A lot of people don't know their purpose

00:07:41.081 --> 00:07:43.364
and if you don't know your purpose,

00:07:43.364 --> 00:07:46.697
your immediate goal is to figure that out

00:07:46.697 --> 00:07:49.165
'cause other wise you're
just wondering around here.

00:07:49.165 --> 00:07:50.752
So the moment you can figure out

00:07:50.752 --> 00:07:53.063
what it is you're supposed to be doing,

00:07:53.063 --> 00:07:54.474
the sooner you're able to get

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:56.229
about the business of doing that.

00:07:56.229 --> 00:07:57.926
My life is fueled by my being

00:07:57.926 --> 00:08:00.106
and the being fuels the doing

00:08:00.106 --> 00:08:02.708
so I come from a centered place,

00:08:02.708 --> 00:08:04.999
I come from a focused place.

00:08:04.999 --> 00:08:06.916
I come from compassion,

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:10.918
it's just my nature,

00:08:10.918 --> 00:08:14.017
I come from a willingness to understand

00:08:14.017 --> 00:08:15.892
and to be understood

00:08:15.892 --> 00:08:18.809
and I come from wanting to connect.

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:24.334
The secret of that show
for 25 years is that

00:08:24.334 --> 00:08:28.784
people could seem themselves
in me all over the world,

00:08:28.784 --> 00:08:30.867
they could see themselves in me.

00:08:30.867 --> 00:08:32.534
And even as I became

00:08:33.915 --> 00:08:37.482
more and more financially successful,

00:08:37.482 --> 00:08:38.606
which was a big surprise to me,

00:08:38.606 --> 00:08:39.562
it was like oh my God,

00:08:39.562 --> 00:08:42.836
this is so exciting.
(crowd laughs)

00:08:42.836 --> 00:08:44.233
- [Host] You mean you got
more than that 30 thousand.

00:08:44.233 --> 00:08:48.400
- I got more than 30 thousand
by the time I was 30.

00:08:51.341 --> 00:08:54.835
But what I realized is
through the whole process

00:08:54.835 --> 00:08:57.835
because I'm grounded in my own self,

00:09:00.435 --> 00:09:03.602
that although I could have more shoes,

00:09:04.614 --> 00:09:05.853
my feet stayed on the ground,

00:09:05.853 --> 00:09:07.076
although I was wearing better shoes.

00:09:07.076 --> 00:09:08.964
These are kind of cute today, too.

00:09:08.964 --> 00:09:09.797
(crowd laughs)

00:09:09.797 --> 00:09:11.393
So I could keep my feet on the ground even

00:09:11.393 --> 00:09:13.259
though I could get more shoes

00:09:13.259 --> 00:09:16.817
and I could understand that it really was

00:09:16.817 --> 00:09:18.734
because I was grounded.

00:09:19.732 --> 00:09:22.439
I was doing, and continue to this day,

00:09:22.439 --> 00:09:25.269
to do the consciousness work.

00:09:25.269 --> 00:09:27.269
I work at staying awake.

00:09:28.107 --> 00:09:30.940
Dear beautiful brown-skinned girl.

00:09:35.371 --> 00:09:36.796
And I use the word beautiful

00:09:36.796 --> 00:09:40.963
because I know that's never a
word you would call yourself.

00:09:42.077 --> 00:09:45.494
I look into your eyes and I see the light

00:09:46.555 --> 00:09:48.138
and hope of myself.

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:50.617
In this photo,

00:09:52.051 --> 00:09:54.468
you're just about to turn 20,

00:09:55.633 --> 00:09:58.426
posing outside the television station

00:09:58.426 --> 00:10:02.280
where you were recently
hired as a reporter.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:04.780
You look calm, you look happy,

00:10:06.089 --> 00:10:08.797
but I know how scared you are.

00:10:08.797 --> 00:10:12.832
If I could say anything
to you it would be,

00:10:12.832 --> 00:10:15.415
relax, it's going to be okay girl.

00:10:17.665 --> 00:10:19.214
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:10:19.214 --> 00:10:22.528
I made this video because
Valerie Brown asked me to

00:10:22.528 --> 00:10:23.935
so if there's a famous entrepreneur

00:10:23.935 --> 00:10:25.276
that you want me to pull from next,

00:10:25.276 --> 00:10:26.755
leave it in the comments below.

00:10:26.755 --> 00:10:28.187
I'll see what I can do.

00:10:28.187 --> 00:10:31.464
I'd also love to know which
of Oprah's top 10 rules

00:10:31.464 --> 00:10:32.828
you connected with the most,

00:10:32.828 --> 00:10:34.015
leave it in the comments

00:10:34.015 --> 00:10:35.859
and we're going to join the discussion.

00:10:35.859 --> 00:10:37.238
Thank you so much for watching.

00:10:37.238 --> 00:10:40.821
Continue to believe and I'll see you soon.

